    {
      "id": "vnRO6o8e0pbS4Uae1yDZ0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2174.498767215381,
      "y": -995.119752394861,
      "width": 1322.442331398515,
      "height": 529.2164435760966,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "ofUMFREE37l11bKGFWLbf",
        "8WVsfFy2yIDMYcGGnA6ew",
        "_AjjoJJYKhPeHu2rtBJKv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0tV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1870781414,
      "version": 1698,
      "versionNonce": 1430514938,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787911619619,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "text": "    Web scraping is the process of extracting data\nfrom various websites and parsing it. In other\nwords, it’s a technique to extract unstructured\ndata and store that data either in a local file or\nin a database. There are many ways to collect\ndata that involve a huge amount of hard work and\nconsume a lot of time. Web scraping can save\nprogrammers many hours.",
      "fontSize": 52.92164435760966,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "right",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    Web scraping is the process of extracting data from various websites and parsing it. In other words, it’s a technique to extract unstructured data and store that data either in a local file or in a database. There are many ways to collect data that involve a huge amount of hard work and consume a lot of time. Web scraping can save programmers many hours.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
